            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyberсube</strong> is a fast-paced action platformer where you take control of a cube and overcome increasingly difficult challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete 100 levels, each featuring a unique combination of obstacles and mechanics. Switch between layers, change direction at the right moment, avoid deadly hazards, and unlock new designs for your cube's core by progressing through the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why play Cyberсube?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced and simple gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 unique levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obstacles with different mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable cube core designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive and challenging gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun to play with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements and Trading Cards.</p></li></ul>",
